nd -22 for the rest of the game, and Opus 5.5 resigned after White's F1."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "The only program run was libs.py, which parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberties with no move generation or lookahead. The other commands just read and appended to the games.md notes file, so everything worked on the current position or on records.", "stop": false}}